{
  "id": "391",
  "title": "Ben's Diary – Lili's Birthday",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2017-10-20",
  "synopsis": "Ben learns a valuable lesson about Chinese culture when celebrating Lili's birthday.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/552/771b7c125b59f80d2a9f574a2ba42943f4f95c15.mp3?1508043925",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "本的日记-生日\n\n2017年9月30日 晴\n    昨天是丽丽的生日，我去丽丽家过生日。我买了一个漂亮的钟送给丽丽，但是丽丽不太喜欢。后来我才知道，中国人不喜欢在生日的时候送钟，因为“送钟”和“送终”听起来一样，不太好。我再也不在生日送别人钟了。",
    "traditional": "本的日記-生日\n\n2017年9月30日 晴\n    昨天是麗麗的生日，我去麗麗家過生日。我買了一個漂亮的鐘送給麗麗，但是麗麗不太喜歡。後來我才知道，中國人不喜歡在生日的時候送鐘，因為“送鐘”和“送終”聽起來一樣，不太好。我再也不在生日送別人鐘了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben's Diary – Birthday"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "2017年9月30日 晴",
      "traditional": "2017年9月30日 晴",
      "pinyin": "4 nián 1 yuè 2 rì qíng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "2017-09-30 Clear skies"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "昨天是丽丽的生日，我去丽丽家过生日。",
      "traditional": "昨天是麗麗的生日，我去麗麗家過生日。",
      "pinyin": "zuó tiān shì lì lì de shēng rì wǒ qù lì lì jiā guò shēng rì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "我买了一个漂亮的钟送给丽丽，但是丽丽不太喜欢。",
      "traditional": "我買了一個漂亮的鐘送給麗麗，但是麗麗不太喜歡。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ mǎi le yí ge piào liang de zhōng sòng gěi lì lì dàn shì lì lì bú tài xǐ huan",
      "english": "Yesterday was Lili's birthday. I went to her house to celebrate her birthday."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "后来我才知道，中国人不喜欢在生日的时候送钟，",
      "traditional": "後來我才知道，中國人不喜歡在生日的時候送鐘，",
      "pinyin": "hòu lái wǒ cái zhī dào zhōng guó rén bù xǐ huan zài shēng rì de shí hou sòng zhōng",
      "english": "I bought a beautiful watch and gave it to Lili, but she didn't like it very much."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "因为“送钟”和“送终”听起来一样，不太好。",
      "traditional": "因為“送鐘”和“送終”聽起來一樣，不太好。",
      "pinyin": "yīn wèi sòng zhōng hé sòng zhōng tīng qǐ lái yí yàng bú tài hǎo",
      "english": "Afterwards I found out that Chinese people don't like to give watches as birthday presents."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "我再也不在生日送别人钟了。",
      "traditional": "我再也不在生日送別人鐘了。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ zài yě bú zài shēng rì sòng bié ren zhōng le",
      "english": "Because “giving a watch” sounds the same as “paying one's last respects”, so it's not very good."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I will never give anyone a watch on their birthday again."
    }
  ],
