      "Yesterday was Lili's birthday. I went to her house to celebrate her birthday.",
      "I bought a beautiful watch and gave it to Lili, but she didn't like it very much.",
      "Afterwards I found out that Chinese people don't like to give watches as birthday presents.",
      "Because “giving a watch” sounds the same as “paying one's last respects”, so it's not very good.",
      "I will never give anyone a watch on their birthday again.",
